    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/ab1c925f2c2e987d15eb3045734aa0bd.poster.avif?t=1747308650\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/ab1c925f2c2e987d15eb3045734aa0bd.webm?t=1747308650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/ab1c925f2c2e987d15eb3045734aa0bd.mp4?t=1747308650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Immerse Yourself in Medieval Life with The Tavern Tales!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In The Tavern Tales,</strong> you become the owner of a small, old tavern inherited from your family. Numerous opportunities and challenges await, helping you turn it into a thriving hub of city life:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Management:</strong> Purchase ingredients, take orders, prepare dishes, and serve drinks, personally engaging in every process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licenses and Recipes:</strong> Acquire licenses to sell alcohol, learn new recipes for food and drinks, and experiment with exotic options that may lead to unexpected results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interior Improvement:</strong> Add tables, chairs, decorations, and other design elements to attract more guests and create a cozy atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden:</strong> Take care of your garden, grow produce, and earn more by selling it or using it in cooking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expeditions:</strong> Send sailors to distant lands for exotic resources, seeds, decorations, and recipes. But be cautious \u2014 not all discoveries are safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serving the Elite:</strong> Don\u2019t forget to please important guests, or the consequences may be unpleasant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notice Board:</strong> Keep an eye on city news and announcements \u2014 they might influence your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action you take matters. Manage your tavern, tend to your garden, send out expeditions, and interact with city residents. Your decisions will shape the reputation and growth of your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/775c245d82b4f9f42206493fb3ea7b51.poster.avif?t=1747308650\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/775c245d82b4f9f42206493fb3ea7b51.webm?t=1747308650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/775c245d82b4f9f42206493fb3ea7b51.mp4?t=1747308650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the master of your destiny.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expand your tavern\u2019s possibilities by adding new services and decor elements. Enhance it and transform it into a gathering place for all social classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Tavern Tales,</strong> you\u2019ll experience a variety of engaging events and content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your path to success by interacting with different social strata.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore exotic recipes and resources that could change the course of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in city events and respond to unexpected challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/1d4b24cb8e6d19c5b7a7a92289c37f7a.poster.avif?t=1747308650\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/1d4b24cb8e6d19c5b7a7a92289c37f7a.webm?t=1747308650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/1d4b24cb8e6d19c5b7a7a92289c37f7a.mp4?t=1747308650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Story of Success</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tavern Tales</strong> is an exciting story of how a small, old tavern becomes a thriving center of life in a medieval city. Your efforts, decisions, and actions will determine the future of the establishment and create a legend to be remembered for centuries.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/ab1c925f2c2e987d15eb3045734aa0bd.poster.avif?t=1747308650\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/ab1c925f2c2e987d15eb3045734aa0bd.webm?t=1747308650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/ab1c925f2c2e987d15eb3045734aa0bd.mp4?t=1747308650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Immerse Yourself in Medieval Life with The Tavern Tales!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In The Tavern Tales,</strong> you become the owner of a small, old tavern inherited from your family. Numerous opportunities and challenges await, helping you turn it into a thriving hub of city life:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Management:</strong> Purchase ingredients, take orders, prepare dishes, and serve drinks, personally engaging in every process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licenses and Recipes:</strong> Acquire licenses to sell alcohol, learn new recipes for food and drinks, and experiment with exotic options that may lead to unexpected results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interior Improvement:</strong> Add tables, chairs, decorations, and other design elements to attract more guests and create a cozy atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden:</strong> Take care of your garden, grow produce, and earn more by selling it or using it in cooking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expeditions:</strong> Send sailors to distant lands for exotic resources, seeds, decorations, and recipes. But be cautious \u2014 not all discoveries are safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stron