graph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/1d4b24cb8e6d19c5b7a7a92289c37f7a.poster.avif?t=1747308650\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/1d4b24cb8e6d19c5b7a7a92289c37f7a.webm?t=1747308650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363530/extras/1d4b24cb8e6d19c5b7a7a92289c37f7a.mp4?t=1747308650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Story of Success</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tavern Tales</strong> is an exciting story of how a small, old tavern becomes a thriving center of life in a medieval city. Your efforts, decisions, and actions will determine the future of the establishment and create a legend to be remembered for centuries.</p>",
